# Achievements

- Spec: `specs/achievements.spec.md` · Skill: `.cursor/skills/achievements/SKILL.md`
- Progresso em storage separado (`side_hero_achievements`), não no `GameState`
- Novos achievements = entrada no `AchievementCatalog` + evento/hook
- Wow via `AchievementUpdateDto` no tick (progresso e unlock)
